# PLAN-935 T-09 — SQ-B finite scalar template instances family (closed-form
# values through the PRODUCT entries that consume the instances lane).
#
# Every program compiles under the `ac.source.instances.scalar/v1` capability
# (the product entries route through compile_scalar_product's instances lane:
# solver-driven discovery → concrete instances → the SAME concrete Checked HIR
# every backend consumes). Oracles are hand-computed closed-form values:
#
# * choose42:  Design42 §10.3 verbatim — choose(true,false,true)=true guards
#              choose(40,42,false)=42 -> main = 42 (two real instances);
# * choose0:   the SAME call sites with the template branches swapped -> 0
#              (instance bodies really re-produce; callers unchanged);
# * expected-type: T solved ONLY by the expected type (let x int = make())
#              -> make_i32() = 0, x + 42 = 42;
# * cross-wrap: wrap<T> body calls choose (fixpoint materialization) —
#              wrap(false,true)=choose(false,true,true)=false takes the else
#              arm, wrap(40,42)=choose(40,42,true)=40 -> 40;
# * recursion: pick(2,40) recurses into pick(1,40) then pick(0,40)=seed -> 40
#              (self-recursion binds to the SAME instance);
# * neg-hetero: choose(40, true, false) binds T to i32 and bool — the real
#              solver rejects with type-mismatch (no implicit conversion).
#
# The instances-layer negative controls (solver-off cold/warm, tampered
# instance pages, restore/first-edit, A-B-A, single-flight counters, budget
# states) are pinned by the `ace-source-query` crate tests carried by the
# `ace-semantics` fixed package group.

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace.m1.inst935.choose42"
  tags: ["ace-m1", "source-instances", "sq-b", "plan-935"]
  links: ["PLAN-935"]
  source: { file: "src/choose42.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "av", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: { recipe: "ac-av/core-run-v1", av: { entry: "d_main", caps: ["ac.source.instances.scalar/v1"] }, steps: [ { op: "run" } ] },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 42 } },
    { id: "ac-native", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: { recipe: "ac/mir-native-scalar-v1", mn: { entry: "d_main", caps: ["ac.source.instances.scalar/v1"] }, steps: [ { op: "run" } ] },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 42 } }
  ]
}
```

